msgid "PROP_0"
msgstr "Restores two hull points. Tanks with full hull leave it for someone else."

msgid "PROP_1"
msgstr "Absorbs two damage points. The laser pierces the shield."

msgid "PROP_2"
msgstr "A fast shell for catching tanks before they turn or reach cover."

msgid "PROP_3"
msgstr "Fires three shells in a spread using one charge."

msgid "PROP_4"
msgstr "A slow, heavy shell that deals two damage on a direct hit."

msgid "PROP_5"
msgstr "Charges for one second, then destroys every tank in the beam. It pierces walls. The shooter stays still until the shot ends."

msgid "PROP_6"
msgstr "Explodes on impact or when the fuse ends. The blast damages nearby tanks. Walls provide cover."

msgid "BOT_0"
msgstr "A stationary target with three lives for practicing shots and testing props."

msgid "BOT_1"
msgstr "Fixed rules switch between chasing, firing, dodging, and repairing."

msgid "BOT_2"
msgstr "Uses an action priority tree. It checks danger and damage before attacking."

msgid "BOT_3"
msgstr "Plans sequences such as retreating before repairing or finding a firing lane after rearming."

msgid "BOT_4"
msgstr "Scores legal actions and considers what it could do next."

msgid "BOT_5"
msgstr "Learns to rank legal actions by playing previous versions of itself."

msgid "BOT_6"
msgstr "Knows the solution and drives to cells to advance them one shell at a time."

